models.dev
----------

Site: https://models.dev
Source: https://github.com/anomalyco/models.dev
API: https://models.dev/api.json

A maintainer tool (`scripts/sync_model_catalog.py`) copies context windows,
max output, modalities, and pricing from that API onto curated rows in
`runtime/src/mas/runtime/spec/llm-model-catalog.yaml`. The runtime does not
fetch models.dev. `tests/fixtures/models-dev-api-subset.json` is a truncated
snapshot used by that tool's tests.

